    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Devoted of Ynnead",
    "summary": "When the opponent’s Shooting phase ends, check whether it cost you any Ynnari units. If so, choose one of your Ynnari Infantry or Mounted units within 6 inches of a Ynnari unit lost during that phase. The response is optional and uses a Normal move with a D6+1 inch limit. You can modify one Ynnari Fade Back Agile Manoeuvre per turn. Swap its Normal move for a Surge move capped at D6+1 inches. As the Fight phase opens, choose a Ynnari unit that is below Starting Strength and lacks the Titanic keyword. It gets Fights First for that phase.",
